  "worked_solution": "For any set $A,$ we have $|P(A)|={2}^{|A|}.$ \n\nIn this case, $|A|=5,$ so we have\n\n$$\n|P(A)|={2}^{|A|}={2}^{5}=32.\n$$\n\nRemember that ${1,2}$ is a single element in the set $A,$ and the same is true for ${5,6}.$",
